total 8
-rw-r--r-- 1 root root  79 Oct 22 04:25 README.md
-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 192 Oct 22 04:25 app.log
--- not tested: non-writable logs/ ---
The container runs as root (permission bits are ignored) and the scratch path is not traversable by an
unprivileged user, so the "logs/ not writable" case could not be reproduced honestly here. /users and
/users/{id} call $logger->info() -> StreamHandler(logs/app.log); '/' does not log.

